# Hub main LFS sha256 bf1aba9ce8d9..., 343,490,560 B, the file of Hub commit 2670e142, 2026-10-31) on the
# protocol row, native-benchmark-1024x256 = litert_lm_advanced_main --benchmark, prefill forced to exactly 1024 tokens,
# decode 256, context 2048 (methodology/agreed-protocol-gemma4.md "The spec"), LiteRT-LM CPU on the flat pinned build
