# campaign dir (this one: 2026-11-04-d549ab-qwen306b-cpu-0190-pixel8a-android); the runner's 120 s cooldown and thermal
# wait before each launch, taskset f0 (the dashboard job's Pixel 8a mask), BENCH_SITTING=1 (each launch checked against
